1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:11,333
Welcome to TrustGate — the Concordium gateway where autonomous AI agents meet real accountability, micro-payments, and verifiable trust.

2
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:23,333
No anonymous bots allowed. Every agent is minted into Concordium's CIS-8004 registry, cryptographically tied to a verified human owner.

3
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:33,333
With the CIS-8 standard, external execution keys on Base EVM are securely bound to the Concordium identity layer.

4
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:40,667
When a verified agent calls the gate, TrustGate issues an HTTP 402 challenge.

5
00:00:40,667 --> 00:00:49,000
The agent settles 0.002 CCD automatically, and data is instantly released.

6
00:00:50,500 --> 00:01:01,000
When a rogue or unverified script attempts access, the bouncer immediately rejects it with an HTTP 403 Forbidden.

7
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:11,000
Every single request generates an immutable audit log, fully compliant with EU AI Act Article 12.

8
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:19,667
TrustGate. Verified. Monetized. Accountable. Launch the control plane on Concordium today.
